<title>MEXICO: ING BARINGS APPOINTS MURIEL AS MEXICO MANAGER.</title>
<headline>ING BARINGS APPOINTS MURIEL AS MEXICO MANAGER.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Internationale Nederlanden Groep NV affiliate ING Barings announced Wednesday that Carlos Muriel Gaxiola has been appointed general manager of its Mexico office, based in Mexico City.</p>
<p>Muriel succeeds Walter Butler, who has moved to Atlanta as head of the turnaround advisory group, a new business venture for ING Barings in the United States.</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530)) E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com</p>
